ortant part in in  China proper we know that with regard to  this epidemics the Chinese economy the  Chinese factories are affected and that  that by definition also it affects the  global chains and global economy this is  a serious issue but as I said already  earlier at this time our paramount  priority our paramount concern should be  devoted to public health measures and  the economic consequences are of course  secondary although not unimportant thank  you  [Music]
 

